{
  "model": "routing_device",
  "subject": "routing.device",
  "local_only": false,
  "comment": "device_out.py with cfg = 1.0, no sign flip (the x(-0.5) DAC scaling is not reproduced, MIX-060, our choice) and the app's own output-trim table plugged into OutputVolume (device_out.load_table is never called). Not reproduced: the BulkMute re-toggle quirk (a change back in the block right after a fade is adopted without a fade by the reference); the cases toggle at least two blocks apart.",
